    "sections": {
        "description": "The HR Staffing Agency theme is designed for recruitment firms, HR consultants, hiring agencies, job placement services, and corporate hiring departments that need a professional website to manage job listings and candidate applications. It includes structured layouts for job postings, candidate profiles, company services, and contact forms, making it easier to present staffing services and recruitment solutions online. The theme supports resume submissions, job search filters, service pages, and company profile sections to help agencies organize hiring information clearly. It is suitable for staffing companies, talent acquisition teams, outsourcing firms, and HR service providers who want to showcase job opportunities, recruitment services, and company information in a clean and organized way. With responsive design, service pages, job listing sections, and contact management features, this theme helps HR and recruitment businesses manage their online presence efficiently."
    },
